{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794369117278,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_4e2a5b00254349f496fb22bf","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat /workspace/Dockerfile 2>/dev/null; echo ---; cat /workspace/backend/requirements.txt 2>/dev/null; echo ---; ls -R /workspace/backend /workspace/frontend 2>/dev/null | head -50"},"output":"FROM node:24-slim@sha256:c86ecead9e55a5210ac1727de38a4ca840bf03dcaf34dc9749addbf383b1920c AS frontend\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json* frontend/\nRUN cd frontend \\\n    && if [ -f package-lock.json ]; then npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; else npm install --no-audit --no-fund; fi\nCOPY frontend/ frontend/\nRUN cd frontend && npm run build\n\nFROM python:3.13-slim@sha256:ae14d4ce8771606477a81446e7ef429edd6762305fc50c84507c1041fa8285d1\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \\\n    PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \\\n    PORT=8000\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\nRUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n    else \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n    fi\nCOPY backend/ backend/\nCOPY --from=frontend /app/frontend/dist frontend/dist\nRUN mkdir -p data\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"gunicorn\", \"--bind\", \"0.0.0.0:8000\", \"--pythonpath\", \"backend\", \"app:app\"]\n---\nflask==3.1.3\ngunicorn==26.2.0\n---\n/workspace/backend:\napp.py\nrequirements.lock\nrequirements.txt\n\n/workspace/frontend:\nindex.html\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nsrc\nvite.config.ts\n\n/workspace/frontend/src:\nApp.tsx\nmain.tsx\n","metadata":{"output":"FROM node:24-slim@sha256:c86ecead9e55a5210ac1727de38a4ca840bf03dcaf34dc9749addbf383b1920c AS frontend\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY frontend/package.json frontend/package-lock.json* frontend/\nRUN cd frontend \\\n    && if [ -f package-lock.json ]; then npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; else npm install --no-audit --no-fund; fi\nCOPY frontend/ frontend/\nRUN cd frontend && npm run build\n\nFROM python:3.13-slim@sha256:ae14d4ce8771606477a81446e7ef429edd6762305fc50c84507c1041fa8285d1\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 \\\n    PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1 \\\n    PIP_DISABLE_PIP_VERSION_CHECK=1 \\\n    PORT=8000\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY backend/requirements.txt backend/requirements.lock* backend/\nRUN if [ -f backend/requirements.lock ]; then \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock; \\\n    else \\\n      pip install --no-cache-dir -r backend/requirements.txt; \\\n    fi\nCOPY backend/ backend/\nCOPY --from=frontend /app/frontend/dist frontend/dist\nRUN mkdir -p data\nEXPOSE 8000\nCMD [\"gunicorn\", \"--bind\", \"0.0.0.0:8000\", \"--pythonpath\", \"backend\", \"app:app\"]\n---\nflask==3.1.3\ngunicorn==26.2.0\n---\n/workspace/backend:\napp.py\nrequirements.lock\nrequirements.txt\n\n/workspace/frontend:\nindex.html\npackage-lock.json\npackage.json\nsrc\nvite.config.ts\n\n/workspace/frontend/src:\nApp.tsx\nmain.tsx\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat /workspace/Dockerfile 2>/dev/null; echo ---; cat /workspace/backend/requirements.txt 2>/dev/null; echo ---; ls -R /workspace/backend /workspace/frontend 2>/dev/null | head -50","time":{"start":1794369117055,"end":1794369117268}},"id":"prt_1c8bbdb74001F4WGrPOH03QPvU","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","messageID":"msg_1c8bbbfcb001Qqkm6GACgq6cIU"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794369117450,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_54d7b908fb164b548b8bb4bc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"ls -la /workspace && cat /workspace/README.md 2>/dev/null"},"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 node node 4096 Nov 11 03:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 11 03:51 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  118 Jan  1  1970 .dockerignore\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node node 4096 Nov 11 03:51 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1062 Jan  1  1970 Dockerfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  887 Jan  1  1970 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 backend\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 frontend\n# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","metadata":{"output":"total 32\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 node node 4096 Nov 11 03:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 root root 4096 Nov 11 03:51 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  118 Jan  1  1970 .dockerignore\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 node node 4096 Nov 11 03:51 .git\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node 1062 Jan  1  1970 Dockerfile\n-rw-r--r-- 1 node node  887 Jan  1  1970 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 backend\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 node node 4096 Jan  1  1970 frontend\n# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"ls -la /workspace && cat /workspace/README.md 2>/dev/null","time":{"start":1794369117039,"end":1794369117302}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c8bbdb60001TYEtHblFXH1gwP","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","messageID":"msg_1c8bbbfcb001Qqkm6GACgq6cIU"}}
