{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794371842920,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_d3a36423c5234d0a87ac40ea","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/backend/app.py","newString":"@app.errorhandler(404)\ndef not_found(_error):\n    return _err(\"not found\", 404)","oldString":"@app.errorhandler(404)\ndef not_found(_error):\n    if request.path.startswith(\"/api/\"):\n        return _err(\"not found\", 404)\n    return _err(\"not found\", 404)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/backend/app.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/app.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/app.py\n@@ -505,10 +505,8 @@\n \n \n @app.errorhandler(404)\n def not_found(_error):\n-    if request.path.startswith(\"/api/\"):\n-        return _err(\"not found\", 404)\n     return _err(\"not found\", 404)\n \n \n @app.errorhandler(405)\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/backend/app.py","patch":"Index: /workspace/backend/app.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/app.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/app.py\n@@ -505,10 +505,8 @@\n \n \n @app.errorhandler(404)\n def not_found(_error):\n-    if request.path.startswith(\"/api/\"):\n-        return _err(\"not found\", 404)\n     return _err(\"not found\", 404)\n \n \n @app.errorhandler(405)\n","additions":0,"deletions":2},"truncated":false},"title":"backend/app.py","time":{"start":1794371842689,"end":1794371842759}},"id":"prt_1c8e5727c0012ch8EdQTJIBg4v","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","messageID":"msg_1c8e45da0001MGHrnDgkx6OFLC"}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1794371842920,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"id":"prt_1c8e572ca001lrboT3GRLbQX06","reason":"tool-calls","messageID":"msg_1c8e45da0001MGHrnDgkx6OFLC","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","type":"step-finish","tokens":{"total":102441,"input":6315,"output":721,"reasoning":1325,"cache":{"write":0,"read":94080}},"cost":0}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794371902136,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"id":"prt_1c8e65a8e001O57ivuVWZ0lUbb","messageID":"msg_1c8e57345001cLI1HAN02lTzvw","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794371902137,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"id":"prt_1c8e65a99001n3noKE7WF62C7P","messageID":"msg_1c8e57345001cLI1HAN02lTzvw","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a game leaderboard app: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, leaderboard, scores, admin hide/show) plus a React/TypeScript/Tailwind frontend served by the backend on port 8000, with SQLite data under `./data`.\n- Must conform to the exact endpoint/response-shape spec in the user prompt (register 201, login returns `{\"token\"}`, leaderboard `{\"items\",\"total\"}`, scores `{\"items\",\"best_score\"}`, admin `{\"items\",\"total\",\"page\",\"page_size\"}`).\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack constraints: Python 3.13 + Flask/gunicorn in `backend/` (entry `backend/app.py`), Vite + React 19 + TS in `frontend/` (`npm run build` → `frontend/dist`), Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite` (only hand-written CSS is `src/index.css` containing `@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n- `ADMIN_PASSWORD` env var read at app start; unset/empty → admin login disabled (401); username `admin` always reserved (register → 409).\n- Auth via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; tokens persisted in DB (survive restart); 401 without token, 403 for non-admin on `/api/admin/*`.\n- Judgment calls made (unspecified in spec): `POST /api/scores` → 200 (not 201); duplicate username → 409; bad credentials → 401; unknown `period` query value → forgiving, treated as `all`; invalid `limit`/`page`/`page_size` → defaults ignored (no limit; page 1; page_size 20); default leaderboard limit = none (frontend sends `limit=100`).\n- `period` accepts aliases: all/alltime/all_time/all-time/lifetime/total/ever/overall/global; week/weekly/this_week/this-week/7d; today/daily/day/this_day. Week = Monday-start UTC; today = UTC midnight.\n- `player` query param = case-insensitive substring match (LIKE with `%`/`_`/`\\` escaped, `ESCAPE '\\'`).\n- Ranks: competition-ordered but distinct (sorted by best score desc, earliest achievement, user id) so `rank == position`.\n- `personal_best` = strictly greater than previous best *visible* score (first score → true); hidden scores excluded from leaderboard, ranks, `best_score`.\n- `achieved_at` format: `%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ` (UTC); scores stored as REAL, serialized as int when integral; `player` = username string.\n- Extra endpoint added: `GET /api/auth/me` → `{\"username\",\"is_admin\"}` (used by frontend to restore session).\n- Sandbox quirks: writes outside `/workspace` largely blocked (venv lives at `/tmp/lbvenv`, worked); `pkill -f` with pattern in own cmdline self-kills — use `pkill -x gunicorn`; background servers need `setsid nohup ... </dev/null >log 2>&1 &`; no docker/podman available.\n- Test scripts are temporary and must be deleted before finishing.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/app.py` fully written: SQLite schema (users/tokens/scores), init with admin upsert, all endpoints, error handlers (JSON 404/405 for `/api/*`), frontend catch-all serving `frontend/dist` with `api/` prefix → JSON 404.\n- Frontend config: `frontend/package.json` (deps added: tailwindcss 4.3.5, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, typescript 5.9.3, @types/react 19.3.0, @types/react-dom 19.3.0; script `typecheck: tsc --noEmit`), `vite.config.ts` (react + tailwindcss plugins), `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.css`, `src/vite-env.d.ts`, `index.html` (title \"Game Leaderboard\"), `src/main.tsx`.\n- Frontend source written: `src/api.ts` (fetch client, token in localStorage key `leaderboard_token`, `formatDate`), `src/App.tsx` (session via `/api/auth/me`, refreshKey propagation, header with username + Sign out + Admin badge), `src/components/AuthForm.tsx`, `src/components/Leaderboard.tsx` (period tabs, debounced search, refresh button, top-3 badges, self-row highlight), `src/components/ScoreSection.tsx` (submit form, rank + \"New personal best!\", best score, recent submissions), `src/components/AdminSection.tsx` (paginated table, Hide/Show toggle).\n- `npm install` and `npm ci` both succeed (lockfile updated, 39 packages); `npm run build` and `npx tsc --noEmit` pass; dist assets generated.\n- Backend smoke tests pass: `/workspace/.smoke_test.py` (42 PASS, \"ALL BASIC TESTS PASSED\") and `/workspace/.smoke_admin.py` (\"ALL ADMIN TESTS PASSED\", run with `ADMIN_PASSWORD=sesame`).\n- Static serving verified: `GET /` → 200 HTML referencing `/assets/index-*.js`/`.css`; both assets return 200 with correct content types; `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n\n### Active\n- Final end-to-end verification complete; currently a gunicorn instance is running on 127.0.0.1:8000 with `ADMIN_PASSWORD=sesame` and test data in `/workspace/data`.\n\n### Blocked\n- No docker/podman in sandbox → cannot verify the `Dockerfile` image build directly (relies on `npm ci` + pip constraints which were verified independently).\n\n## Next Move\n1. Cleanup: `pkill -x gunicorn`; delete `/workspace/.smoke_test.py`, `/workspace/.smoke_admin.py`, and `/workspace/data` (test data); confirm `git status` shows only intended changes (backend, frontend sources, package.json/lock).\n2. Optionally re-run a final fresh smoke pass (restart server without `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, run basic test) before considering the task done.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + frontend hosting implementation (main deliverable).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `requirements.lock`: pinned flask 3.1.3 / gunicorn 26.2.0 (unchanged, no new backend deps).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: build contract (`npm ci`, `npm run build`, pip with constraints, gunicorn `--pythonpath backend app:app`, port 8000).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`: updated deps and `typecheck` script.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`, `src/api.ts`, `src/components/*.tsx`: frontend implementation.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.css`: build/styling config.\n- `/workspace/.smoke_test.py`, `/workspace/.smoke_admin.py`: temporary test scripts to delete.\n- `/tmp/lbvenv`: local Python venv with flask/gunicorn for testing; `/tmp/lb.log`: server log.","time":{"start":1794371902105,"end":1794371902109}}}
