{"type":"text","timestamp":1794372141399,"sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","part":{"id":"prt_1c8ea0127001oG3xNTrQMkJP36","messageID":"msg_1c8e9cbc3001o3SfQDTr1EXs6v","sessionID":"ses_e3744480affex77CITZAUDwa8q","type":"text","text":"Everything is verified and cleaned up. Final state:\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask API on `/api` — register/login (Bearer tokens in SQLite), leaderboard (period/limit/player, hidden excluded, competition ranking), score submission with `rank` + `personal_best`, personal scores with `best_score`, admin list/toggle, `/api/health`, plus serving `frontend/dist`. Hardened auth parsing, overflow-safe scores, and register race → 409.\n\n**Frontend**: React 19 + TS + Tailwind v4 — auth forms, leaderboard with period tabs/search/refresh/highlight, score submission with rank + \"New personal best!\", admin hide/show with pagination. `tsc` and `npm run build` pass; CSS scoped to `src/` for deterministic builds.\n\n**Verified**: 58 smoke checks pass (basic 39 + admin 19), static serving works, data persists across restarts, admin upsert works on re-start. Docker build steps (`npm ci`, `npm run build`, pip constraints) verified individually — no docker in sandbox to test the image itself.\n\nTest scripts, test data, and `__pycache__` removed; `git status` shows only intended changes.","time":{"start":1794372141351,"end":1794372141356}}}
